s anyone in the castle  this is interesting because lyanna was  also known to be very comfortable on a  horse  benjen follows this up by saying those  are notable achievements john  so john says then take me with you when  you go back to the wall  father will give me leave to go if you  ask him i know he will  the scene is nearly identical to the one  we saw in the show  the only difference is this one happens  inside winterfell  whereas in the show it happened out in a  courtyard  now what they say next that wasn't in  the show is very interesting  some of you may have already heard me  talk about this if you watched my video  where i showed all the book evidence  that indicates jon snow is a king  this is when jon mentioned someone by  the name of darren targaryen  he says darren was only 14 years old  when he conquered dorne  the same age as john in this chapter the  young dragon was one of john's heroes  but benjen reminds jon of how that story  ends  he says your boy king lost thousands of  men taking dorne  and another 50 000 trying to hold it  someone should have told him that war  isn't a game also darren was only 18  years old when he died  or have you forgotten that so as you can  see  jon has a lot of interesting  similarities to this darren targaryen  they both achieve a lot at a very young  age but they also both die at a very  young age although i believe jon will be  resurrected in the books  jon tells benjen about how much he has  thought about this decision  to serve in the night's watch he says  someday robb will inherit winterfell  and command great armies as the warden  of the north bran and rickon will go on  to become robb's bannermen  and rule holdfasts in his name arya and  sansa will go on to marry the heirs of  other great houses  but what can a bastard like jon hope to  earn  there is nothing here for jon he says a  bastard can have honor too  i am ready to swear your oath benjen  says  come back to me after you've fathered a  few bastards of your own  and we'll see how you feel this made jon  furious  he says i will never father a bastard  never  he sped it out like venom only then is  when john realizes how loud he was  speaking  everyone else at the table fell silent  now they're all staring back at him  jon was so upset he had to excuse  himself from the feast  he ran out of the room before anyone  could see him cry like many of us who  have drank a lot at one time or another  you don't realize how drunk you are  until you stand up  that's exactly what happens to jon now  if things weren't bad enough  it only got worse when jon went to run  out of the room he slams into a serving  girl  as he's leaving knocking everything she  was holding onto the floor  now everyone begins laughing at jon he  let his emotions get the best of him  but you know alcohol tends to do that so  john and ghost go running outside into  the courtyard and this is when jon meets  tyrion lannister  as jon is out here he hears someone say  boy  when jon looks to see where the noise  came from he notices tyrion was sitting  on the ledge above the door to the great  hall  as you can see this is not how jon and  tyrion meet in the show  in the book version tyrion is sitting on  the ledge of the building like he's a  gargoyle  tyrion is curious about ghost he wants  to have a closer look at him  john hesitates at first but he does  allow it he asks tyrion if he's able to  climb down himself  or does he need a ladder this is when  tyrion shows us he could be in circus  delay  he throws himself off the ledge into the  empty air  john is shocked but he watches it all as  tyrion lannister spun around in the ball  landed lightly on his hands then vaulted  backward onto his legs  he's like a little ninja even ghost  backs away from him with uncertainty  now most of this interaction unfolds the  same way it does in the show  what i want to focus on is how the scene  ends after tyrion jumps down off the  ledge  he spends a few moments with ghost but  then he introduces himself to jon  he says i am tyrion lannister but jon  already knows that  as we all know tyrion is the most famous  dwarf in all the seven kingdoms  but then tyrion says you're ned stark's  bastard  aren't you now we all know jon doesn't  like to be called that  but he's still very angry from what just  happened inside with his uncle  so he feels even more offended than he  usually does  tyrion notices this and says i'm sorry  but you are the bastard though  jon says lord eddard stark is my father  and tyrion says yes i can see it you  have more the north than you than your  brothers  this is something that does make jon  happy to hear he just wants to feel like  he's one of the starks  but he doesn't let this show on his face  then tyrion gives him one of the most  famous lines from the story  one of my favorite lines if i might add  now let me just show you because after  this is when things get very interesting  let me give you some advice bastard  never forget what you are the rest of  the world will not  wear it like armor and it can never be  used to hurt you  jon was not in the mood for anyone's  advice john says what do you know about  being a bastard  tyrion says all dwarves are bastards in  their father's eyes  so john says but aren't you your  mother's true  born son tyrion says am i  do tell my lord father my mother died  giving birth to me  and he's never been sure now i'm sure  most of you remember this from the show  but tywin never believed that tyrion was  his son  he most likely knew the mad king was his  real father  because of what happened during the  night he wed tyrion's mother  not only that but i think taiwan was  smart enough to see that tyrion had some  of the targaryen's features  like the different colored eyes and the  white blonde hair  but i want to show you how the chapter  ends because this is even more  fascinating than what i've shown you  thus far when tyrion goes to leave the  courtyard  he opens the door in the light from  within the room throws his shadow across  the yard  and for just a moment it says tyrion  lannister stood tall as a king  i believe george r martin is definitely  giving us something to think about  i can't help but wonder why are all  these lines about tyrion and jon snow's  chapters  another character who is a secret  targaryen i would like to know what all  of you think about the theory  i've never made a video about this  before so i really don't know what my  subscribers think about it  now keep in mind there is a whole lot  more evidence than just this  i'm only showing you what was in john's  chapter but i will definitely show you  more  as we go through the other chapters in  the books  i want you to leave me your thoughts  down below i would love to see what you  have to say  like i said at the beginning of the  video if you would like to have early  access to my videos  and support the channel consider joining  me and everyone else over on my patreon  that would really help out a lot either  way i want to thank everyone for  watching the video  i hope you all have a great day i will  see you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  so  you
 

